			<Placemark>
				<name>2MWt IRT-2000 研究反应堆</name>
				<description><![CDATA[活动性：运行中。朝鲜于1965 年五/六月份从前苏联获得，该反应堆1967年开始运行。<br>
国际原子能机构安全条约:Type-66 国际原子能机构安全条约(1977签署),1992 国际原子能机构-朝鲜 安全条约<br>
来源：国际核不扩散研究中心Monteray研究所<br>
原文如下：<br><hr>
Activities: Operating. North Korea received this reactor from the former Soviet Union in May/June 1965. The reactor became operational in 1967. <br>

IAEA safeguards: Covered by the Type-66 IAEA safeguards agreement (signed in 1977), and the 1992 IAEA-North Korea safeguards agreement. <br>

Source: <br>
Monteray Institute of International Studies
Center for Nonproliferation Studies<br>]]></description>
